WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,900
what i thought

2
00:00:01,440 --> 00:00:02,680
I drive the prophet

3
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:04,200
It's clear as day

4
00:00:05,170 --> 00:00:06,370
The first time he saw us

5
00:00:06,370 --> 00:00:09,150
But this is definitely not the first time Lu Qien looks like this.

6
00:00:09,150 --> 00:00:11,520
He almost bullied Captain Rong to death

7
00:00:12,220 --> 00:00:13,500
I am Lu Qien from KGD

8
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:14,780
Captain Lu also wants to know your name.

9
00:00:14,780 --> 00:00:17,420
Why are you so polite? Rong Ying looks polite but is not polite at all.

10
00:00:17,420 --> 00:00:18,420
No need to keep it with him

11
00:00:18,420 --> 00:00:19,580
Just be what you usually are

12
00:00:19,580 --> 00:00:21,460
By the way, why did you come out? Where are the other people in your base?

13
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:23,140
I'm still relying on your help in City C.

14
00:00:23,140 --> 00:00:24,980
Everyone moved to the suburbs for another month

15
00:00:24,980 --> 00:00:26,020
The base will be out tomorrow

16
00:00:26,540 --> 00:00:28,460
Speaking of which, I am very grateful to Captain Han.

17
00:00:28,620 --> 00:00:30,500
It's no big deal, they're all lucky ones.

18
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:31,460
It's a handful if you can pull it

19
00:00:33,290 --> 00:00:34,330
Just know

20
00:00:34,330 --> 00:00:35,650
This is not simple anymore

21
00:00:35,650 --> 00:00:36,930
I thought it was better for you

22
00:00:36,930 --> 00:00:39,610
It would be nice if I could change you a little bit, I didn’t expect it

23
00:00:40,250 --> 00:00:41,370
Your calculation goes deeper
